cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, cite this metadata together with the exact local
  commit identifier. This development checkout is not a published release;
  no public repository, DOI or release date is asserted.
type: software
title: "csv2massing: explicit-input schematic building massing with provenance"
authors:
  - name: "ParalleX Labs Inc."
abstract: >-
  A Python command-line workflow specified to convert a seven-column CSV,
  explicitly supplied WGS84 building footprints and per-building evidence
  into schematic GeoJSON and self-contained glTF prisms. It preserves
  source references, units, uncertainty and validation findings. Unknown
  height remains null and produces no model. It does not extract PDFs,
  generate detailed facades, export SLPK or I3S, or publish to ArcGIS Online.
keywords:
  - building massing
  - provenance
  - GeoJSON
  - glTF
  - reproducibility
  - schematic geometry
license: Apache-2.0
